  "notes": [
    {
      "id": 87,
      "at": [
        -12,
        -34
      ],
      "text": "A 256-byte parallel static RAM on a Blue Pill (STM32CubeIDE-style HAL project firmware/hal_parallel_ram):\ndata D0-D7 on PA0-PA7, address A0-A7 on PB8-PB15, OE on PB0, WE on PB1, CE on GND. Run (F5): the firmware\nfills the RAM with a pattern, checks it and writes a text (Analyzer > UART), then counts in the byte at\n0x20. Window > Memory Viewer shows the RAM live; Save as... keeps its contents in a file."
    }
  ]
}
